  "triggers": [
    {
      "id": "underlumen_enter",
      "event": "room_entered",
      "actions": [
        { "type": "showMessage", "lines": [
          "The raider fortifications end abruptly. Below lies something far older.",
          "The walls here are smooth — not carved, but grown. Geometric patterns pulse with a faint inner light that responds to your sol unit's proximity. The material is warm despite the Nightside cold.",
          "This is Underlumen architecture. The ancient substrate that the Unbounded speak of in whispered legends. And it's responding to you."
        ]},
        { "type": "setQuestObjective", "text": "Navigate the Underlumen chambers" }
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "puzzle_1_hint",
      "event": "room_entered",
      "conditions": [
        { "not": { "hasFlag": "underlumen_puzzle_1_solved" } }
      ],
      "actions": [
        { "type": "showMessage", "text": "Two crystal pedestals flank a sealed passage ahead. The geometric patterns on the floor suggest they need to be activated — light placed in the right positions to open the way." }
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "puzzle_1_pedestal_left",
      "event": "door_interacted",
      "filter": { "tileX": 6, "tileY": 6 },
      "conditions": [
        { "not": { "hasFlag": "underlumen_puzzle_1_solved" } }
      ],
      "actions": [
        { "type": "setFlag", "flag": "underlumen_p1_left", "scope": "room" },
        { "type": "showMessage", "text": "You channel sol energy into the left pedestal. It glows with a steady blue-white light, and the geometric patterns on the floor pulse outward toward the sealed passage." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "puzzle_1_pedestal_right",
      "event": "door_interacted",
      "filter": { "tileX": 10, "tileY": 6 },
      "conditions": [
        { "not": { "hasFlag": "underlumen_puzzle_1_solved" } }
      ],
      "actions": [
        { "type": "setFlag", "flag": "underlumen_p1_right", "scope": "room" },
        { "type": "showMessage", "text": "You channel sol energy into the right pedestal. It flares to life, and the geometric lines on the walls brighten — tracing a path toward the sealed passage." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "puzzle_1_check",
      "event": "flag_changed",
      "conditions": [
        { "hasFlag": "underlumen_p1_left" },
        { "hasFlag": "underlumen_p1_right" },
        { "not": { "hasFlag": "underlumen_puzzle_1_solved" } }
      ],
      "actions": [
        { "type": "setFlag", "flag": "underlumen_puzzle_1_solved" },
        { "type": "showMessage", "lines": [
          "Both pedestals align. The geometric patterns converge on the sealed passage, and the crystal barrier dissolves into motes of light.",
          "The Underlumen responds to focused light in specific positions — spatial control. Place light sources to hold zones."
        ]},
        { "type": "setTile", "x": 6, "y": 6, "tileId": 2 },
        { "type": "setTile", "x": 10, "y": 6, "tileId": 2 },
        { "type": "grantXp", "amount": 30 }
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "mid_chamber_enter",
      "event": "door_interacted",
      "filter": { "tileX": 6, "tileY": 6 },
      "conditions": [
        { "hasFlag": "underlumen_puzzle_1_solved" },
        { "not": { "hasFlag": "underlumen_puzzle_2_hint" } }
      ],
      "actions": [
        { "type": "setFlag", "flag": "underlumen_puzzle_2_hint" },
        { "type": "showMessage", "lines": [
          "A wider chamber opens up. The geometric patterns here are more complex — three sealed gates at cardinal positions, and three crystal pedestals.",
          "The floor markings suggest a sequence: each pedestal must be activated in the right order. The faintest traces of light show the intended path."
        ]}
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "puzzle_2_pedestal_left",
      "event": "door_interacted",
      "filter": { "tileX": 9, "tileY": 12 },
      "conditions": [
        { "hasFlag": "underlumen_puzzle_1_solved" },
        { "not": { "hasFlag": "underlumen_puzzle_2_solved" } }
      ],
      "actions": [
        { "type": "setFlag", "flag": "underlumen_p2_left", "scope": "room" },
        { "type": "showMessage", "text": "The left pedestal activates. Light pulses outward along the floor grooves, reaching toward the central chamber." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "puzzle_2_pedestal_right",
      "event": "door_interacted",
      "filter": { "tileX": 17, "tileY": 12 },
      "conditions": [
        { "hasFlag": "underlumen_puzzle_1_solved" },
        { "not": { "hasFlag": "underlumen_puzzle_2_solved" } }
      ],
      "actions": [
        { "type": "setFlag", "flag": "underlumen_p2_right", "scope": "room" },
        { "type": "showMessage", "text": "The right pedestal blazes to life. Two beams of light now converge on the final pedestal below." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "puzzle_2_check",
      "event": "flag_changed",
      "conditions": [
        { "hasFlag": "underlumen_p2_left" },
        { "hasFlag": "underlumen_p2_right" },
        { "not": { "hasFlag": "underlumen_puzzle_2_solved" } }
      ],
      "actions": [
        { "type": "setFlag", "flag": "underlumen_puzzle_2_solved" },
        { "type": "showMessage", "lines": [
          "The two beams merge and cascade downward. The final sealed passage cracks open, revealing stairs spiraling deeper into the Spire's foundation.",
          "Your sol unit is vibrating — not from cold, but from resonance. Something below is responding to your presence. Something ancient and powerful."
        ]},
        { "type": "setTile", "x": 9, "y": 12, "tileId": 2 },
        { "type": "setTile", "x": 17, "y": 12, "tileId": 2 },
        { "type": "grantXp", "amount": 40 },
        { "type": "setQuestObjective", "text": "Descend to the Spire's core" }
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "puzzle_2_gate_left_locked",
